  "description": "ETEYAG crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C104 H96 N18 O22 Yb4 Zn2 2+,2(C2 H3 N1),2(Na1 1+),0.9(N1 O3 1-),3.1(N3 1-),2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 7 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Zn1 (Zn) has 2 O neighbors; Yb1A (Yb) has 7 O neighbors; Yb2A (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Zn1A (Zn) has 2 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.506-3.745 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 105.19-109.22°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Zn2Yb4(L1)4(L2)2(OAc)2(N3)2][Na2(OH2)2(NO3)0.9(N3)3.1]·2MeCN (C108H106N31.6Na2O24.6Yb4Zn2). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 0 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 0 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
